            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Messages notifications without a link open their conversation anyway, by the sender, the way Karui for iPhone does; Contacts access is asked for the first time
- Mark as hides Read when nothing selected is unread, and greys out the category a selection already has
- The inbox keeps everything from the last month instead of stopping at 3,000 notifications
- Sync Now's status shows while something is selected too
]]></description>
